<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Contact Dorphil Restaurant in Mfuwe, Zambia, for menu enquiries, directions and bookings."><title>Contact & Location | Dorphil Restaurant</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css"><script defer src="js/main.js"></script><script defer src="js/forms.js"></script></head>
<body><div class="announcement"><span class="status-dot"></span> Dorphil Restaurant & Take Away <span class="announcement-divider">•</span> Mfuwe, Zambia</div><header class="site-header" id="top"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark">D<span>•</span></span><span class="brand-name">DORPHIL<small>RESTAURANT & TAKE AWAY</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-nav"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button><nav class="main-nav" id="main-nav"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="about.html">Our Story</a><a href="menu.html">Menu</a><a href="events.html">Events</a><a href="reservations.html">Reservations</a><a class="active" href="contact.html">Contact</a><a class="nav-cta" href="menu.html">Explore Menu <span>↗</span></a></nav></header>
<main><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-inner reveal"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">WE'RE EASY TO REACH</p><h1>Let's <em>connect.</em></h1><p>Questions about a meal, directions or an event? Get in touch.</p></div><div class="page-hero-decoration">↗</div></section>
<section class="section wrap contact-layout"><div class="contact-details reveal"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT DORPHIL</p><h2>We'd love<br><em>to hear from you.</em></h2><div class="contact-detail"><span>☎</span><div><small>PHONE</small><a href="tel:+260975868663">+260 975 868663</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><span>✆</span><div><small>WHATSAPP</small><a href="https://wa.me/260975868663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message the restaurant ↗</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><span>⌖</span><div><small>LOCATION</small><strong>Mfuwe village, Kakumbi, Zambia</strong><p>One block toward the airport from the local market and gas station.</p></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><span>◷</span><div><small>HOURS</small><strong>Listed as closing at 9:30 PM</strong><p>Call ahead to confirm today's opening hours.</p></div></div><a class="button button-green full-button" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dorphil+Restaurant+VRQ5%2B5X4+Kakumbi+Zambia" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions on Google Maps ↗</a><p class="small-note">Map pin should be checked with the restaurant before launch.</p></div>
<div class="map-panel reveal"><div class="map-topline"><span class="map-pin">⌖</span><div><strong>Dorphil Restaurant</strong><small>Mfuwe, Zambia</small></div></div><iframe title="Map showing the Mfuwe area near Dorphil Restaurant" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Dorphil%20Restaurant%20Mfuwe%20Zambia&t=&z=13&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe><div class="map-caption"><span>⌖</span><p>VRQ5+5X4, Kakumbi<br><small>Confirm the exact pin before visiting.</small></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section form-band"><div class="wrap form-layout"><div class="form-aside reveal"><p class="eyebrow">SEND AN ENQUIRY</p><h2>What's on<br><em>your mind?</em></h2><p>Use this form to prepare a message to the restaurant. You can review it before sending on WhatsApp.</p></div><form class="contact-form reveal" id="contact-form" data-form-type="General enquiry"><div class="form-heading"><h2>Contact form</h2><p>Fields marked * are required.</p></div><div class="form-row"><label>Your name *<input name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Phone or email<input name="contact" placeholder="How can we reach you?"></label></div><label>Subject *<select name="subject" required><option value="">Choose a subject</option><option>Menu question</option><option>Order enquiry</option><option>Table reservation</option><option>Party or event</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Message *<textarea name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Write your message..."></textarea></label><button class="button button-green form-submit" type="submit">Prepare WhatsApp message ↗</button><p class="form-note">Your message opens in WhatsApp. It is only sent when you press Send there.</p><p class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section></main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark">D<span>•</span></span><span class="brand-name">DORPHIL<small>RESTAURANT & TAKE AWAY</small></span></a><p>Local flavours. Warm hospitality.<br>Mfuwe, Zambia.</p><div class="footer-links"><a href="about.html">Our Story</a><a href="menu.html">Menu</a><a href="events.html">Events</a><a href="reservations.html">Reservations</a></div><a class="footer-phone" href="tel:+260975868663">+260 975 868663 ↗</a></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© <span id="year"></span> Dorphil Restaurant</span><span>Made for Mfuwe, with care.</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><a class="floating-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/260975868663" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Contact Dorphil on WhatsApp">✆</a></body></html>